{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16885","headline":"独不见 · 武元衡","name":"独不见","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"荆门一柱观，楚国三休殿。\n环佩俨神仙，辉光生顾盼。\n春风细腰舞，明月高堂宴。\n梦泽水连云，渚宫花似霰。\n俄惊白日晚，始悟炎凉变。\n别岛异波潮，离鸿分海县。\n南北断相闻，叹嗟独不见。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"武元衡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16885.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16885","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}